      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"549\">Managing construction machinery in real time is no longer a luxury — it’s a necessity. Our telematics solutions provide full visibility into your equipment, helping you reduce costs, improve efficiency, and prevent misuse.</p><p data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"788\">By integrating industry-leading platforms like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Wialon</span></span> and hardware solutions such as <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Xirgo</span></span> devices, we deliver a powerful system tailored specifically for construction sites.</p><p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"927\">Whether your machines are operating on large infrastructure projects, urban developments, or remote terrains, you always stay in control.</p>",
      "bodyText": "Managing construction machinery in real time is no longer a luxury — it’s a necessity. Our telematics solutions provide full visibility into your equipment, helping you reduce costs, improve efficiency, and prevent misuse.By integrating industry-leading platforms like Wialon and hardware solutions such as Xirgo devices, we deliver a powerful system tailored specifically for construction sites.Whether your machines are operating on large infrastructure projects, urban developments, or remote terrains, you always stay in control.",
