      "bodyHtml": "<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1099\">We provide advanced tracking and monitoring of all critical machine parameters:</p><p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1751\">All data is available in a centralized dashboard, giving you actionable insights in real time.</p>",
